{"kind":"pr","url":"https://github.com/MagnoOsseus/380/pull/19","repo":"MagnoOsseus/380","number":19,"set":"agent","source":"copilot-agent","title":"Add brief inline comments to behavior tree node files","body":"Stripped all comments from a set of decorator and leaf nodes, then re-added concise, human-style `//` comments — only where they genuinely clarify non-obvious logic.\n\n## Decorators\n- `D_DaytimeOnly.h/.cpp` — one-liner class description; comments on the entry-guard condition and the `on_exit` READY reset\n- `D_CooldownFly.h` / `D_CooldownFight.h` — single-line noting the success/failure cooldown durations (12s/4s and 10s/3s)\n\n## Leaves (cpp)\nComments added only where they add value:\n- Interrupt/abort conditions that aren't self-evident (`// Interrupt sleep if panic or wolf alert triggers`, `// Abort if panic — fleeing takes priority`)\n- Random probability thresholds (`// 30% chance to pick a fight`, `// 20% random chance to attempt a fly`)\n- One-time-per-day guards (`// Already chopped today — don't do it again`)\n- Agent-type branching (`// Wolf goes to the den; chickens/roosters go to the roost`)\n- State transitions that need context (`// Panic ended — clean up and succeed`, `// Don't pick new prey while the wolf is already fleeing`)","authorType":"Bot","additions":34,"deletions":49,"changedFiles":24,"files":[{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Decorator/D_CooldownFight.h","additions":1,"deletions":3},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Decorator/D_CooldownFly.h","additions":1,"deletions":3},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Decorator/D_DaytimeOnly.cpp","additions":2,"deletions":5},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Decorator/D_DaytimeOnly.h","additions":2,"deletions":6},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Leaf/L_ChaseWolf.cpp","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Leaf/L_CutDown.cpp","additions":1,"deletions":1},{"path":"framework/Source/Student/Project_1/Leaf/L_FeedAni